00:15:52.525 --> 00:15:55.585
In summary, what does all this tell us?

00:15:56.084 --> 00:15:58.275
Let's look at how all the formulas work.

00:15:58.995 --> 00:16:02.314
So originally, if we started
from a concentration of H

00:16:02.584 --> 00:16:07.694
we can convert that to pH.

00:16:08.495 --> 00:16:12.365
In order to convert that, we
needed to use the negative log

00:16:13.074 --> 00:16:16.425
of H in order to convert that.

00:16:17.645 --> 00:16:22.785
If you wanted to go backwards,
we can do that as well, where

00:16:22.785 --> 00:16:27.694
we take the inverse of a log, so
that would be 10 to the minus 10.

00:16:28.219 --> 00:16:29.930
pH to go.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:34.849
Let's make that a little bit
